	<!-- Armor Descriptions -->

	<!-- EN: Mitigation effect against sharp attacks, such as bullets, stabs, slashes, scratches and bites.\n\nWhen a sharp attack meets armor, this rating is used to reduce the attack's penetration and damage, the stopped part of the attack decaying into a blunt attack. As the armor rating increases, more of the sharp attack is converted into a blunt one, until the rating exceeds the penetration amount and the attack fully decays into a blunt one. For example, a sharp attack with 10 mm RHA penetration after 8 mm RHA of armor keeps 20% of its damage and penetration, with 80% of its blunt penetration being used for a residual blunt attack.\n\nThe reduction effect applies per layer, with each layer (including natural armor) decaying the sharp attack into a blunt one until the attack pierces through all layers or fully decays.\n\nThis rating also doubles as an armor's resistance against being damaged by sharp attacks. Hard armors (armor vests, full plate) take more damage the closer a sharp attack's penetration amount is to the armor rating, whereas soft armors (parkas, dusters) take the amount of damage stopped or at least 20% of the attack's damage. The damage and penetration reduction per layer also affects armor damage, with upper layers reducing the damage inner layers take.\n\nThe internal formulas used:\n - For reducing a sharp attack's damage and penetration per layer:\n    Remaining_Sharp_Penetration = Max(0, Sharp_Penetration - Sharp_Armor_Rating)\n	Sharp_Damage = Sharp_Damage * Remaining_Sharp_Penetration / Sharp_Penetration\n	Sharp_Penetration = Remaining_Sharp_Penetration\n\n - For the residual blunt attack's damage and penetration:\n	Stopped_Sharp_Penetration = Intial_Sharp_Penetration - Final_Sharp_Penetration\n	Blunt_Penetration = Blunt_Penetration * Stopped_Sharp_Penetration / Intial_Sharp_Penetration\n    Blunt_Damage = (Blunt_Penetration * 10) ^ (1 / 3) -->
	<ArmorRating_Sharp.description>对利器攻击（如子弹、刺击、挥砍、抓挠和啃咬）的减伤效果。\n\n利器攻击命中护甲时，该数值会降低攻击的穿透力和伤害，而被阻挡的部分会衰减为一次钝器攻击。护甲值越高，转化为钝器攻击的部分就越多；当护甲值超过穿透力时，利器攻击会完全衰减为钝器攻击。例如，穿透力为 10 mm RHA 的利器攻击经过 8 mm RHA 的护甲后，会保留 20% 的伤害和穿透力，并以原钝器穿透力的 80% 产生一次残余钝器攻击。\n\n该削减效果会逐层计算；每层护甲（包括天然护甲）都会使利器攻击进一步衰减为钝器攻击，直至攻击穿透所有护甲层或完全衰减。\n\n此数值也作为护甲自身抵抗利器攻击损伤的能力。对于硬质护甲（防弹背心、全身板甲），利器攻击的穿透力越接近护甲值，对护甲造成的损伤就越大；对于软质护甲（风雪大衣、防尘大衣），护甲会承受其阻挡的伤害量，且至少承受该次攻击伤害的 20%。逐层发生的伤害和穿透力削减也会影响护甲损伤，因此外层护甲会降低内层护甲受到的损伤。\n\n内部使用的公式：\n - 每层护甲对利器攻击伤害和穿透力的削减：\n    剩余利器穿透力 = max(0, 利器穿透力 - 利器护甲值)\n	利器伤害 = 利器伤害 * 剩余利器穿透力 / 利器穿透力\n	利器穿透力 = 剩余利器穿透力\n\n - 残余钝器攻击的伤害和穿透力：\n	被阻挡的利器穿透力 = 初始利器穿透力 - 最终利器穿透力\n	钝器穿透力 = 钝器穿透力 * 被阻挡的利器穿透力 / 初始利器穿透力\n    钝器伤害 = (钝器穿透力 * 10) ^ (1 / 3)</ArmorRating_Sharp.description>

	<!-- EN: Mitigation effect against blunt attacks, such as punches, mace swings, explosions and animal hoofs.\n\nWhen a blunt attack meets armor, this rating is used to reduce the attack's penetration and damage. As the armor rating increases, more of the blunt attack is reduced, until the rating exceeds the penetration amount and the attack is completely stopped. For example, a blunt attack with 10 MPa after 8 MPa of armor keeps 20% of its damage and penetration.\n\nThe reduction effect applies per layer, with each layer (including natural armor) reducing the blunt attack until it travels through all layers or is completely stopped.\n\nThis rating also doubles as an armor's resistance against being damaged by blunt attacks. Hard armors (armor vests, full plate) take more damage the closer a blunt attack's penetration amount is to the armor rating, whereas soft armors (parkas, dusters) take no damage. The damage and penetration reduction per layer also affects armor damage, with upper layers reducing the damage inner layers take.\n\nThe internal formula used for reducing a blunt attack's damage and penetration per layer:\n  Remaining_Blunt_Penetration = Max(0, Blunt_Penetration - Blunt_Armor_Rating)\n  Blunt_Damage = Blunt_Damage * Remaining_Blunt_Penetration / Blunt_Penetration\n  Blunt_Penetration = Remaining_Blunt_Penetration -->
	<ArmorRating_Blunt.description>对钝器攻击（如拳击、狼牙棒挥击、爆炸和动物蹄击）的减伤效果。\n\n钝器攻击命中护甲时，该数值会降低攻击的穿透力和伤害。护甲值越高，钝器攻击受到的削减就越多；当护甲值超过穿透力时，攻击会被完全阻挡。例如，穿透力为 10 MPa 的钝器攻击经过 8 MPa 的护甲后，会保留 20% 的伤害和穿透力。\n\n该削减效果会逐层计算；每层护甲（包括天然护甲）都会进一步削弱钝器攻击，直至攻击穿过所有护甲层或被完全阻挡。\n\n此数值也作为护甲自身抵抗钝器攻击损伤的能力。对于硬质护甲（防弹背心、全身板甲），钝器攻击的穿透力越接近护甲值，对护甲造成的损伤就越大；软质护甲（风雪大衣、防尘大衣）则不会受到钝器攻击的损伤。逐层发生的伤害和穿透力削减也会影响护甲损伤，因此外层护甲会降低内层护甲受到的损伤。\n\n每层护甲削减钝器攻击伤害和穿透力时使用的内部公式：\n  剩余钝器穿透力 = max(0, 钝器穿透力 - 钝器护甲值)\n  钝器伤害 = 钝器伤害 * 剩余钝器穿透力 / 钝器穿透力\n  钝器穿透力 = 剩余钝器穿透力</ArmorRating_Blunt.description>

	<!-- EN: Percentage reduction of attack damage from extreme heat or cold, such as fire, incendiary explosions, or frostbite-inflicting attacks.\n\nThe total across all sources of this armor is added for a protected part, then reduced by the armor reduction value of the incoming attack. If the resulting value is 100% or greater, protected parts of the pawn will be immune to the incoming attack's hot or cold damage. -->
	<ArmorRating_Heat.description>对极端高温或低温造成的攻击伤害（如火焰、燃烧爆炸或造成冻伤的攻击）的百分比减免。\n\n来自所有来源的此类护甲值会在受保护部位上累加，再减去来袭攻击的护甲削减值。如果结果达到或超过 100%，角色受到保护的部位将免疫来袭攻击的高温或低温伤害。</ArmorRating_Heat.description>

	<!-- Shooting Accuracy -->

	<!-- EN: weapon handling -->
	<ShootingAccuracyPawn.label>武器操控</ShootingAccuracyPawn.label>
	<!-- EN: How well a shooter can hold a gun steady when aiming and compensate for recoil.\n\nThe total sway is calculated as:\n(4.5 - weapon handling) * weapon sway factor\n\nThe recoil per shot is determined by multiplying this value against the weapon's inherent recoil amount and increases after every shot in a burst. -->
	<ShootingAccuracyPawn.description>衡量射手瞄准时保持枪械稳定并补偿后坐力的能力。\n\n总晃动根据以下公式计算：\n(4.5 - 武器操控) × 武器晃动系数\n\n每发后坐力由该数值与武器的固有后坐量相乘确定，并会在一次连发中每发射一弹后逐渐增加。</ShootingAccuracyPawn.description>

</LanguageData>
